dded. Next: user UAT on dashboard, then decide hardening + integrate into gateway/control UI.\n- 06:53–06:54 UTC: User approved production hardening. Decision: completed hardening package for Ops Cockpit: (1) Basic Auth enforced for dashboard/API, (2) systemd service created/enabled (`ops-cockpit.service`) with auto-restart, (3) secret moved to `/etc/default/ops-cockpit`, (4) old nohup runtime replaced by managed service. Evidence: `systemctl status` = active (running) pid 32016; unauthenticated `/` returns 401 and authenticated returns 200; `/health` OK. RAG: GREEN for requested scope. Owners: Mạnh AI (implementation), Hà AI (service/runtime), Huy AI (UI continuity), PM validation by MINH AI. ETA: done now. Blockers: TLS/HTTPS not yet configured (internet traffic still HTTP). Next: optional step to add reverse proxy + TLS and rotate dashboard password after first login.\n- 07:00 UTC: Hourly PM report generated from evidence in logs/system checks. Decision: keep overall delivery GREEN (MVP+hardening done), set AMBER risk for internet exposure/security scope until TLS and access policy are confirmed. Owners: MINH AI (reporting/governance), Mạnh AI (infra hardening), Huy AI (UI refinements), Hà AI (telemetry/API stability), Huyền AI (AC/UAT traceability). ETA: next 1h focuses on TLS optioning + KPI/alert threshold finalization if user confirms. Blockers: pending user decisions on (1) HTTPS reverse proxy choice, (2) KPI/alert thresholds, (3) remote access policy. Next: await user approvals, then execute hardening sprint and publish verification evidence.\n- 07:00–07:03 UTC: Internal scrum sync executed via sessions_spawn with explicit agentId (manh/huy/ha/huyen); consolidated evidence-based updates received from each. Decision: keep execution focus on artifact-backed delivery in next 1 hour; no new scope added. Owners & ETA: Mạnh AI 07:20 C4+sequence, 07:45 OpenAPI v1 skeleton, 08:00 SLO/contract-test checklist; Huy AI 07:10 gather refs, 07:30 validate FE artifacts, 08:00 publish FE status; Hà AI 07:10 secure backend ticket+AC, 07:20 contract draft, 07:45 initial backend slice/tests, 08:00 verification report; Huyền AI 07:20 SIT dependency map, 07:40 UAT matrix/evidence template, 08:00 blocker escalation memo. Blockers: (1) missing ticket/PR links for FE/BE evidence, (2) payment gateway/UAT env/test data not confirmed, (3) MVP SLA/event-contract ownership pending. RAG: Overall AMBER (planning/architecture progressing, execution evidence incomplete). Next: PM to escalate blockers to PO/Tech Lead/DevOps by 07:15 UTC and re-sync at 08:00 UTC with artifact links.\n- 07:09–07:10 UTC: User requested bot exchange section to display as chat conversation in Vietnamese. Decision: implemented chat-style panel `💬 Hội thoại nội bộ giữa các bot (Tiếng Việt)` in dashboard; backend now emits `projects.chat` with speaker/time/text/rag derived from logs and Vietnamese label normalization. Evidence: service restarted successfully (`ops-cockpit.service` active pid 34879), `/api/metrics` includes populated `projects.chat` entries, UI updated in `public/index.html`. RAG: GREEN (feature delivered). Owners: Huy AI (UI), Hà AI (API payload), Mạnh AI (integration), PM validation by MINH AI. ETA: done now. Blockers: semantic translation still rule-based (not full NLP), may need refinement for cleaner Vietnamese phrasing. Next: collect user feedback on conversation tone and adjust mapping rules.\n- 07:12 UTC: User requested hiding technical content by default with per-message expand button; bot-to-bot communication must stay Vietnamese. Decision: updated chat payload to split `text` (non-technical preview) and `detail` (technical block), and UI now adds `Xem thêm chi tiết kỹ thuật` button in each message to toggle hidden detail inline. Evidence: backend functions `summarize_non_technical_vi` + `extract_technical_details_vi` added; frontend renders toggle button and collapsible detail; service restarted successfully and API returns `text/detail` fields. RAG: